WEBVTT

00:05:28.127 --> 00:05:30.195
not a checkbox to be ticked.

00:05:30.703 --> 00:05:32.751
When talking to young people,

00:05:32.775 --> 00:05:34.581
we have an opportunity to show them

00:05:34.605 --> 00:05:37.918
what it's like to communicate
with care for another person,

00:05:37.942 --> 00:05:42.276
checking in and respecting them
as the authority on what they're feeling.

00:05:43.425 --> 00:05:46.383
If we normalize consent everywhere,

00:05:46.407 --> 00:05:49.687
by the time someone is ready
for a sexual experience,

00:05:49.711 --> 00:05:52.701
they will know that they're allowed
to ask questions,

00:05:52.725 --> 00:05:54.570
stop at any time,

00:05:54.594 --> 00:05:56.213
and most importantly,

00:05:56.237 --> 00:05:57.788
to enjoy themselves.

00:05:58.322 --> 00:06:00.212
Children are our future,